WEBVTT

00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:19.280
Father. Mother.

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:21.970
I do not want to marry Prince Ye.

00:00:21.970 --> 00:00:23.750
I do not even like him!

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:24.700
Husband...

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:27.920
The House of Grand Councilor has been on
bad terms with the Ye Prince for a long time.

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:31.740
If we let Shang'er marry him,
 her life will be ruined!

00:00:32.770 --> 00:00:36.600
Dear wife, I understand
the graveness of the situation.

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:40.180
However, the marriage was arranged
by the emperor. How can I disobey?

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:43.030
I wish there was some alternative...

00:00:43.030 --> 00:00:48.060
Father, you promised I could
choose my own husband.

00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:50.260
I have never met Prince Ye.

00:00:50.260 --> 00:00:52.190
I would rather die than marry him.

00:00:53.460 --> 00:00:55.700
Shang'er, do not say such things.

00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:58.420
As long as I am here, I will not let you suffer.

00:00:58.420 --> 00:00:59.690
Mother...

00:00:58.420 --> 00:01:01.470
Husband, can we not find another solution?

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:03.300
I see no other way.

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:08.380
If we disobey, the entire House of 
Grand Councilor may well be executed.

00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:15.480
Shang'er, you are a woman now.

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:19.850
Do this for your mother and me
and we will ask no more of you.

00:01:20.560 --> 00:01:23.870
Father, I do not wish to marry.

00:01:24.740 --> 00:01:27.060
I am your only daughter.

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:32.240
If I am not here, who will look
after you and love you like I do?

00:01:36.090 --> 00:01:36.920
Husband...

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:42.100
Shang'er... is not our only daughter.

00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:51.200
Dear wife, you speak of the girl
on Spirit Cloud Mountain...

00:01:55.300 --> 00:01:57.220
No. That will not do.

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:01.670
It would be lying to the emperor.

00:02:05.780 --> 00:02:07.850
Our entire clan would pay the price.

00:02:24.140 --> 00:02:25.640
It is no lie, husband.

00:02:26.020 --> 00:02:29.160
The emperor arranged for
our <i>eldest</i> daughter to be wed,

00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:30.710
and Yunxi is our eldest.

00:02:31.280 --> 00:02:34.600
If that is not enough, we can
swap their names and identities.

00:02:50.720 --> 00:02:53.070
They are both our daughters.

00:02:53.550 --> 00:02:55.900
No one will be able to tell them apart.

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:21.020
There is sense in your suggestion, dear wife.

00:03:22.060 --> 00:03:25.900
We must consider how it
would work in the long term.

00:03:33.210 --> 00:03:36.050
<i><i>Of course. I am not their only daughter.</i></i>

00:03:36.050 --> 00:03:37.320
<i><i>I have an elder sister.</i></i>

00:03:38.560 --> 00:03:40.590
<i><i>The half-wit our family disowned.</i></i>

00:03:41.600 --> 00:03:44.220
Wow, this is exciting!

00:03:44.220 --> 00:03:46.900
<i>Marrying into that Ye den 
of wretches instead of me...</i>

00:03:46.900 --> 00:03:48.660
<i>She has finally become useful.</i>

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:53.350
My lady! You must not lift your veil!
It is most improper.

00:03:53.650 --> 00:03:56.690
Oh, come on, let me have a sneaky peek.

00:03:57.520 --> 00:04:00.560
Oh, honestly, my lady.
What do you need to peek at?

00:04:01.060 --> 00:04:02.080
Secret!

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:35.020
Psychic\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hPrincess

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:35.020
Psychic\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hPrincess

00:05:35.310 --> 00:05:38.020
<i>Episode 1</i>

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:53.960
Getting married is such a chore.
I haven't stopped since I got up.

00:05:53.960 --> 00:05:56.040
It's now evening and I still can't rest.

00:05:56.480 --> 00:05:59.290
What's the idea behind having me wait in here?

00:06:02.350 --> 00:06:05.650
Hey! How long do I have to sit here?

00:06:05.650 --> 00:06:07.840
Is there anything else I need to be doing?

00:06:08.550 --> 00:06:11.560
My lady, please do not
 rush your "wifely duties."

00:06:11.560 --> 00:06:13.330
Huh? What does <i>that</i> mean?

00:06:15.050 --> 00:06:17.270
Have patience and you will find out.

00:06:18.230 --> 00:06:22.660
The other concubines say that
Prince Ye is an expert "swordsman."

00:06:22.660 --> 00:06:25.770
His night-time "swordplay" is masterful.

00:06:28.690 --> 00:06:32.420
What <i>are</i> you talking about?
Prince Ye practices his swordplay at night?

00:06:32.850 --> 00:06:36.080
No, no. His Highness will be bathing now.

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:38.350
Ah, so he finished practicing, huh?

00:06:38.350 --> 00:06:42.220
Practicing even on his wedding day...
Maybe he's obsessed with martial arts.

00:06:42.940 --> 00:06:47.310
My lady, did you not know?
The prince practices every night.

00:06:47.310 --> 00:06:50.190
His nickname is "The Night Thruster."

00:06:50.190 --> 00:06:52.220
Hold your tongue! Do you have a death wish?

00:06:57.250 --> 00:06:59.170
<i>How could I forget that bit?</i>

00:06:59.170 --> 00:07:01.760
<i>I did my best, getting
married in Shang'er's place,</i>

00:07:01.760 --> 00:07:03.530
<i>but facing him for real...</i>

00:07:03.530 --> 00:07:06.660
<i>Wh-Wh-What am I going to do?</i>

00:07:14.610 --> 00:07:15.970
Excellent job today, sir.

00:07:18.630 --> 00:07:19.850
Oh no!

00:07:19.850 --> 00:07:22.390
He's coming now?

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:22.390
This is my usual nightly
routine, so I am used to it.

00:07:22.940 --> 00:07:24.470
You prepared your cock just now?

00:07:24.710 --> 00:07:28.420
Yes, I took great care
in plucking it this time.

00:07:33.820 --> 00:07:36.140
Good, good. What do you plan to do with it?

00:07:37.550 --> 00:07:40.810
Tonight, we will begin with
"Dragons Playing with a Pearl."

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:48.050
Followed by "Flying Dragon
 and Dancing Phoenix."

00:07:48.910 --> 00:07:52.110
And then, we reach the climax:

00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:56.220
"Hundreds of Birds Salute the Phoenix."

00:07:56.730 --> 00:07:57.950
How marvelous.

00:07:57.950 --> 00:07:58.970
Yes, very good!

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:03.260
Curse that man. I'll punch him
if he dares to touch me.

00:08:05.220 --> 00:08:10.560
Finally, I can make a delicious soup with the
chicken bones and a few other ingredients.

00:08:10.560 --> 00:08:12.800
Chicken bones? What the...

00:08:14.700 --> 00:08:15.720
<i>Has he left?</i>

00:08:16.430 --> 00:08:17.980
Your Highness!

00:08:24.440 --> 00:08:27.760
I have come tonight to tell you this.

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:28.880
Where is she? She was here a moment ago...

00:08:27.760 --> 00:08:33.800
If His Imperial Majesty had not ordered it,
you would not have set foot in my palace.

00:08:33.800 --> 00:08:36.310
Qian Aotian, you sly old fox...

00:08:36.770 --> 00:08:42.150
You would constrain me with
a political union? Wishful thinking.

00:08:44.800 --> 00:08:48.110
You are naught but a pathetic pawn.

00:08:49.350 --> 00:08:55.580
Listen close. Only Nan Qingwan 
is fit to be my princess.

00:08:54.180 --> 00:08:55.580
Nan Qingwan?

00:08:57.090 --> 00:08:59.790
I see. So you like hiding?

00:08:59.790 --> 00:09:02.350
Perfect. I do not wish to see you, either.

00:09:03.320 --> 00:09:05.600
Attendants, fetch her maid, Su Rong.

00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:08.400
Move her out of the Hall 
of Esteemed Virtue tonight.

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:11.090
A-And move her where?

00:09:11.090 --> 00:09:12.720
The Serenity Pavilion.

00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:20.080
Wh-Wh-Where did His Highness say?

00:09:20.800 --> 00:09:23.580
I-I think... the Serenity Pavilion...

00:09:27.850 --> 00:09:30.300
My lady, please do not be unhappy.

00:09:30.740 --> 00:09:35.930
Yes, His Highness has no doubt
imbibed, and is not himself.

00:09:32.710 --> 00:09:35.930
He's right. I <i>am</i> a pathetic pawn.

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:39.430
I am the misfortune of my parents made flesh.

00:09:37.830 --> 00:09:40.450
My lady? My lady?

00:09:40.450 --> 00:09:45.430
I would like to know if you're satisfied now.

00:09:48.820 --> 00:09:51.420
For I am <i>extremely</i> satisfied!

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:59.330
I no longer have to worry about
pleasing that idiot prince!

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:04.290
Mother, I am free!

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:07.270
I can finally leave this horrible place!

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:07.270
She has lost her mind!

00:10:07.270 --> 00:10:08.520
I will go fetch Su Rong!

00:10:08.980 --> 00:10:10.250
Wait! I will come too!

00:10:13.350 --> 00:10:15.520
God's plans supersede our own.

00:10:15.520 --> 00:10:17.690
I thought the odds were stacked against me.

00:10:17.690 --> 00:10:20.200
I never thought fate would 
let me survive to the end.

00:10:20.640 --> 00:10:24.120
As long as I leave the House of
Grand Councilor, it works for me!

00:10:27.010 --> 00:10:29.770
Why did you react so strangely
at the mention of the Serenity Pavilion?

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:32.750
The Serenity Pavilion is haunted.

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:46.150
This place is nice.

00:10:46.150 --> 00:10:50.050
Not as nice as Spirit Cloud 
Mountain, but I give it ten points.

00:11:05.450 --> 00:11:06.200
This...

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:12.350
Does the prince have to be so miserly?

00:11:12.350 --> 00:11:16.220
There are so many pretty buildings here...
Why do I have to stay in this one?

00:11:19.060 --> 00:11:22.610
Su Rong, can you go ask His Highness 
to find me somewhere else to—

00:11:24.130 --> 00:11:26.350
My lady, I must excuse myself!

00:11:33.970 --> 00:11:38.030
Prince Ye? More like Prince Ye-diot!

00:11:38.030 --> 00:11:40.900
Making a poor, defenseless
woman like me fend for myself...

00:11:40.900 --> 00:11:42.800
What a jerk!

00:11:49.280 --> 00:11:52.940
Evil Prince Ye-diot,
I won't be beaten so easily.

00:11:52.940 --> 00:11:58.020
I, Qian Yunxi, grew up on Spirit 
Cloud Mountain like a wild animal.

00:11:58.020 --> 00:11:59.640
My instinct is to survive.

00:11:59.640 --> 00:12:02.080
Watch me clean this place up in no time.

00:12:06.790 --> 00:12:09.730
What the hey? This is rather embarrassing.

00:12:09.730 --> 00:12:11.930
It looks like I can't do it by myself.

00:12:15.010 --> 00:12:18.180
Okay, you leave me no choice.
I will have to summon my servant.

00:12:18.940 --> 00:12:21.820
You have been chosen. Come forth, Mochi!

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:30.340
How dare you keep me 
locked up for so long!

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:35.070
Oh, sorry, I accidentally forgot
about you. Please forgive me.

00:12:37.780 --> 00:12:41.350
You only care about marriage.
How dare you forget about me!

00:12:41.350 --> 00:12:45.190
Oh, come on, you know <i>why</i> I got married, right?

00:12:45.190 --> 00:12:47.390
All right, all right. I'm sorry, okay?

00:12:47.390 --> 00:12:49.300
There's something I want you to—

00:12:47.850 --> 00:12:51.770
Say what you like. It won't
stop me from punishing you.

00:12:58.290 --> 00:13:01.700
So that's what's going on.
No wonder it's so shabby in here.

00:13:01.700 --> 00:13:04.920
I thought you were living the
high life and forgot all about me.

00:13:06.350 --> 00:13:09.190
Every day since I started
following you has been a bust.

00:13:09.190 --> 00:13:13.150
I thought coming to the bustling capital
from the mountain would improve things.

00:13:13.150 --> 00:13:16.850
I didn't expect the House of Grand
Councilor to bully and insult you.

00:13:16.850 --> 00:13:21.280
I never thought marrying
a prince could change so little.

00:13:21.780 --> 00:13:25.650
Oh, I give up! Your name should 
be Jinxi instead of Yunxi.

00:13:26.130 --> 00:13:28.610
Oh, come on, complaining won't help.

00:13:28.610 --> 00:13:32.390
You've got to think positively, be optimistic,
 and do something meaningful like...

00:13:32.390 --> 00:13:33.020
Like what?

00:13:33.020 --> 00:13:37.780
Like getting this Serenity Pavilion all
cleaned up. It'll make you feel much better.

00:13:38.920 --> 00:13:41.810
What? You want me to do donkey work?

00:13:41.810 --> 00:13:43.900
You're like a blind man
selling a calendar — absurd!

00:13:45.190 --> 00:13:49.020
Come on, dear Mochi,
<i>cute</i> Mochi. You're the best!

00:13:49.020 --> 00:13:51.300
Let's clean it up together. Pretty please?

00:13:54.820 --> 00:13:56.810
No! Absolutely not!

00:13:58.290 --> 00:14:00.500
You know, I can't do it without you.

00:14:04.810 --> 00:14:06.470
Fine. I'll help you this once.

00:14:31.770 --> 00:14:33.220
Serenity Pavilion

00:14:38.130 --> 00:14:42.020
This is all that evil Prince Ye-diot's fault.

00:14:42.020 --> 00:14:45.110
Next time you see him, 
be sure to play a prank on him.

00:14:43.220 --> 00:14:45.730
Prince what? As if I care about some prince.

00:14:45.730 --> 00:14:49.890
Maybe save your energy and figure out how
to live in this place from now on, yeah?

00:14:50.650 --> 00:14:53.600
I'm not worried about that.
Good things happen to lucky people.

00:14:53.600 --> 00:14:56.850
Since we live in this big house now,
there will be food and drink every day...

00:14:58.250 --> 00:15:02.880
Oh, that's right. I've been busy all day 
and haven't even had a chance to eat.

00:15:03.480 --> 00:15:05.100
I'm hungry, too.

00:15:05.100 --> 00:15:07.650
What about your optimism? Can we eat that?

00:15:07.650 --> 00:15:11.600
If we don't eat well, how can we sleep well?
A midnight snack is in order.

00:15:12.270 --> 00:15:14.970
Who's going to give you food
in the middle of the night?

00:15:18.190 --> 00:15:20.720
We won't rely on others. We'll go by ourselves!

00:15:20.720 --> 00:15:21.980
Go where?

00:15:24.650 --> 00:15:26.870
I did a little reconnaissance earlier.

00:15:35.850 --> 00:15:39.220
As soon as I got here, 
I checked out where the kitchen was.

00:15:40.850 --> 00:15:44.220
Are we there yet? This place is so big.

00:15:44.440 --> 00:15:48.260
Hey, wait for me! Don't run so fast!
I can't keep up with you!

00:15:50.480 --> 00:15:52.720
No, something's wrong.

00:15:52.720 --> 00:15:55.260
Something nearby must
be draining my strength.

00:16:07.630 --> 00:16:09.350
Shhh, be quiet.

00:16:09.870 --> 00:16:12.250
We'll be spotted if we
make noise this late at night.

00:16:12.940 --> 00:16:15.790
So you have an accomplice?

00:16:22.730 --> 00:16:23.810
Who are you?

00:16:24.230 --> 00:16:25.470
Who am I?

00:16:25.470 --> 00:16:27.350
<i><i>Oh shoot, he thinks I'm a thief...</i></i>

00:16:27.570 --> 00:16:28.900
I asked you who you were.

00:16:28.900 --> 00:16:30.080
You want to know who I am?

00:16:30.850 --> 00:16:31.770
Who sent you?

00:16:32.010 --> 00:16:32.890
Who sent <i>you</i>?

00:16:33.140 --> 00:16:34.390
I asked you that!

00:16:34.720 --> 00:16:35.900
Who's asking?

00:16:36.520 --> 00:16:37.250
I am—

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:42.030
I am a palace guard. Do you 
have any idea where you are?

00:16:42.520 --> 00:16:43.520
Prince Ye-diot's palace.

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:47.090
How dare you! You break into the
Ye Princely Palace and spout such nonsense?

00:16:47.090 --> 00:16:48.810
Give yourself up or be captured!

00:17:00.060 --> 00:17:01.810
You claim to be a guard?

00:17:01.810 --> 00:17:07.310
Guards don't usually wander around at night
wearing weird gowns instead of a uniform.

00:17:09.350 --> 00:17:11.720
Or maybe... you're having an affair?

00:17:13.900 --> 00:17:17.720
If you dare approach me, I'll start yelling
and everyone in the palace will find out!

00:17:23.480 --> 00:17:25.970
<i><i>He's fast! A master of the arts?</i></i>

00:17:35.270 --> 00:17:37.360
<i><i>Rats, my joints are locked.</i></i>

00:17:39.320 --> 00:17:42.560
Mochi! What are you doing? 
Hurry up and help me!

00:17:43.740 --> 00:17:45.300
<i><i>That ungrateful brat!</i></i>

00:17:45.300 --> 00:17:47.520
<i><i>Where the heck is he when I need him?</i></i>

00:17:56.120 --> 00:17:58.100
<i><i>Lucky I had the psychedelic 
smoke Master gave me.</i></i>

00:18:06.420 --> 00:18:09.970
<i><i>You absolute waste of space. You owe me a meal!</i></i>

00:18:11.020 --> 00:18:12.850
<i><i>Curses, I let that wretch get away.</i></i>

00:18:12.850 --> 00:18:14.850
Your Highness, are you injured?

00:18:14.850 --> 00:18:15.850
I am fine.

00:18:18.760 --> 00:18:22.230
It is the smoke making me feel weak.

00:18:23.440 --> 00:18:25.500
This is definitely not from the capital.

00:18:26.190 --> 00:18:30.210
Is this the handiwork of that
old scoundrel, Qian Aotian?

00:18:34.100 --> 00:18:37.030
<i><i>Master told me life is not decided by fate.</i></i>

00:18:37.030 --> 00:18:40.140
<i><i>You can change your fate
through your own efforts.</i></i>

00:18:41.060 --> 00:18:44.140
<i><i>As such, I do not believe in fate.</i></i>

00:18:44.550 --> 00:18:46.210
<i><i>I believe only in myself.</i></i>

00:18:52.610 --> 00:18:53.870
<i><i>I believe only in myself.</i></i>

00:18:54.350 --> 00:18:59.240
<i>I am Qian Yunxi, and nobody 
gets to tell </i>me<i> what to do!</i>

00:19:05.750 --> 00:19:08.600
Ah, Mochi! How did you fix this?!

00:19:08.600 --> 00:19:11.390
Help me move this sign!
